{"markdown":"We are the Pinnacle of the Roofing Industry\n\n[![Pinnacle Roofing & Sheet Metal, Inc. | Roofer Nanticoke](https://le-cdn.hibuwebsites.com/983869aca4494363a1e28ddf9dfabe34/dms3rep/multi/opt/12139828-200h.png)](https://www.pinnacleroofingpa.com/)\n\n##### Nanticoke -[570-735-7751](tel:570-735-7751)\n\n##### 570-343-7153\n\n###### Serving Northeastern Pennsylvania\n\n- [HOME](https://www.pinnacleroofingpa.com/)\n- [PRODUCTS](https://www.pinnacleroofingpa.com/products/4108043)\n- [SERVICES](https://www.pinnacleroofingpa.com/services/4108099)\n- [ABOUT US](https://www.pinnacleroofingpa.com/about-us/4108103)\n  - [AWARDS](https://www.pinnacleroofingpa.com/awards/4108100)\n  - [EXPERIENCE AND AFFILIATIONS](https://www.pinnacleroofingpa.com/experience-and-affiliations/4108102)\n- [LOCATIONS](https://www.pinnacleroofingpa.com/nanticoke/4108045#LOCATIONS)\n  - [NANTICOKE](https://www.pinnacleroofingpa.com/nanticoke/4108045)\n  - [DICKSON CITY](https://www.pinnacleroofingpa.com/dickson-city/4108235)\n\n* * *\n\n* * *\n\n* * *\n\n# Commercial Roofing﻿\n\nGet an expertly installed commercial roof for your building in good time. Established in 1993, Pinnacle Roofing & Sheet Metal, Inc. has trained and experienced technicians ready to install a sturdy, leak-proof roof on your building.\n\n![Roofing](https://le-cdn.hibuwebsites.com/983869aca4494363a1e28ddf9dfabe34/dms3rep/multi/opt/0-a83e-592be23a95b3-542w.jpg)\n\n### Two Locations\n\n![Commercial](https://le-cdn.hibuwebsites.com/983869aca4494363a1e28ddf9dfabe34/dms3rep/multi/opt/12444037_480x154-559w.jpg)\n\nOur service areas include Luzerne, Lackawanna and Monroe Counties, PA and the towns and surrounding areas of Wilkes Barre, Scranton, Dickson City, and Hazleton, PA.\n\n### Contact one of our locations\n\n### [Nantico](https://www.pinnacleroofingpa.com/contact) ke\\| [Dickson City](https://www.pinnacleroofingpa.com/dickson-city) \\| [Contact Us](https://www.pinnacleroofingpa.com/contact)\n\n### Demonstrated Excellence\n\n![Commercial](https://le-cdn.hibuwebsites.com/983869aca4494363a1e28ddf9dfabe34/dms3rep/multi/opt/12444034_481x158-558w.jpg)\n\nWith 23 years’ experience, we have the knowledge, experience and technology to tackle virtually any roofing project, from new construction to re-roofing to repairs.\n\n### [Learn more about our awards](https://www.pinnacleroofingpa.com/awards/4108100)\n\n[Privacy Policy](http://budurl.com/hibuprivacy) \\| [Do Not Share My Information](http://budurl.com/hibucookie) \\| [Conditions of Use](http://budurl.com/hibuconditionsofuse) \\| [Notice and Take Down Policy](http://budurl.com/hibunotice) \\| [Website Accessibility Policy](http://b.link/accessibility)\n\n© 2026\nThe content on this website is owned by us and our licensors. Do not copy any content (including images) without our consent.\n\nShare by:\n\n\n\n{{placeholder\\_retargeting\\_pixel}}\n\n\n\n{{placeholder\\_dpni}}\n\n\n\n{{placeholder\\_footer\\_reserve1}}\n\n\n\n{{placeholder\\_footer\\_reserve2}}\n\n\n\n{{placeholder\\_footer\\_reserve3}}\n\n\n\n{{placeholder\\_footer\\_reserve4}}\n\n\n\n{{placeholder\\_footer\\_reserve5}}\n\n\n\n{{placeholder\\_footer\\_reserve6}}\n\n\n\n{{placeholder\\_footer\\_reserve7}}","branding":{"colorScheme":"light","fonts":[{"family":"Source Sans Pro","role":"body"},{"family":"Open Sans","role":"unknown"}],"colors":{"primary":"#03779C","secondary":"#FAE231","accent":"#F30E1E","background":"#FFFFFF","textPrimary":"#F30E1E","link":"#F30E1E"},"typography":{"fontFamilies":{"primary":"Source Sans Pro","heading":"Source Sans Pro"},"fontStacks":{"heading":["Source Sans Pro"],"body":["Source Sans Pro"],"paragraph":["Source Sans Pro"]},"fontSizes":{"h1":"36px","h2":"36px","body":"16px"}},"spacing":{"baseUnit":4,"borderRadius":"0px"},"components":{},"images":{"logo":"https://le-cdn.hibuwebsites.com/983869aca4494363a1e28ddf9dfabe34/dms3rep/multi/opt/12139828-200h.png","favicon":"https://cdn.hibuwebsites.com/983869aca4494363a1e28ddf9dfabe34/site_favicon_16_16